<title>USA: Damark to market to credit card holders.</title>
<headline>Damark to market to credit card holders.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Damark International Inc said Friday it signed an agreement with a unit of Household International Inc to market its membership services to a select group of credit card customers.</p>
<p>The agreement with Household Credit Services Inc allows Damark to reach new potential members more affordably, jump-start its membership growth and produce long-term revenue and profit growth, the company said.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not announced.</p>
<p>Damark is a direct marketing company with annual revenues of more than $500 million.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 1/4 Friday at 10-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
